= Solution
{parent=a}

The <curl of a gradient> is zero. Consequently the <dot product> in the exponent vanishes and
$$
\boxed{\exp[\nabla\phi\cdot(\nabla\times\nabla\phi)]=e^0=1}.
$$

= b
{parent=8}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=b}

The <divergence of a curl is zero>, so its squared <absolute value> is
$$
\boxed{|\nabla\cdot(\nabla\times\mathbf F)|^2=0}.
$$
Both identities follow by cancellation of equal <mixed partial derivatives> under the usual smoothness assumptions of <vector calculus>.

= 9
{parent=Paper 2}
